     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p3-reflection-rule",
     "replacement": "To **reflect** a point across the line $y=x$, exchange its $x$- and $y$-coordinates.\n\n$\\begin{gathered}(x,y)\\\\\\downarrow\\\\(y,x)\\end{gathered}$",
